---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Utah Community Outreach | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Our Provo office offers free community outreach services. We’re here to give back—let’s discuss how we can support you. Contact Tangible Mental Health today."}>
<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:21;--mrows:24">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/5/4/23;--m:2/2/4/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h1><span class="c-darkAccent">Community Outreach</span></h1></span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:6/5/22/14;--m:10/2/25/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="shape" style="background:hsla(var(--darkAccent-hsl), 1);border-radius:0px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:6/14/22/23;--m:4/2/10/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><figure class="img fill" style="--fp:63% 50%"><img src="/images/1z8a7158-4-f1cfb1.jpg" alt="A smiling man with a beard and curly hair sitting on a light-colored armchair in a room with a large green plant and framed artwork on the wall." width="4908" height="3373" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:8/6/20/13;--m:11/3/24/9;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="rte"><p class="lg"><span class="c-white">We know what you’re thinking, “What are they trying to sell me?” </span></p><p class="lg"><span class="c-white">The truth is that we work and live in this community and we see our community outreach as a way of giving back. We are excited to offer a variety of free services!</span></p><p class="lg"><span class="c-white">Please get in touch so we can discuss how we can help.</span></p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-dark h-small">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top:10vmax;padding-bottom:10vmax">
<div class="wrap"><div class="list-title rte"><p>How we can help.</p></div><ul class="ulist ulist-carousel" style="--per:3;--ar:4/3;--tfs:calc((1.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--bfs:calc((0.9 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--cw:100%;--gap:20px"><li class="li card"><a class="li-link" href="#" aria-label="Groups"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">Groups</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Everyone needs community. We can host groups on-site, tailored for specific populations or challenges </p></div></div></li><li class="li card"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">Therapy</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Specialization and expertise go a long way. We can provide an expert resource for therapy.</p></div></div></li><li class="li card"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">Training</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Allow our experts to train yours. Specialized training on a variety of mental health approaches.</p></div></div></li><li class="li card"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">Parent Coaching</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Parenting doesn’t come with a play book, but we do. Let us bring parent coaching to you.</p></div></div></li><li class="li card"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">Presentations</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Skill-based practice, it’s who we are. Let us share our skills with your students/families.</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="carousel-nav"><button class="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="next" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-medium has-bg">
<div class="sec-bg"><img src="/images/img-0413-92dd72.jpg" alt="A cozy corner at Tangible Therapy with a sofa, pillows and a stack of books on the coffee table" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="eager"><div class="sec-ov" style="opacity:0.54"></div></div><div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:6;--mrows:7">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/5/4/24;--m:3/2/6/10"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h1>Still have Questions?</h1></span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:5/12/7/16;--m:5/4/7/8"><div class="btn-wrap ta-left"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="mailto:brady@tangiblementalhealth.com?subject=Community%20Outreach" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contact us</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
